messages.content:
{
  "message": "I can help get your mobile data working as fast as possible in France. First, I need to identify your account so I can check and, if needed, enable international roaming on your line and verify your data plan/usage. In parallel, we’ll run a few quick checks on your phone to optimize for the highest speeds.",
  "thought_process": "My plan is: (1) verify your line’s roaming and data status in our system, (2) confirm you haven’t hit your plan’s data limit, (3) ensure international roaming is enabled on the line if it isn’t, and (4) guide you to set your phone to 4G/5G preferred, make sure mobile data and data roaming are ON, disable any VPN/Data Saver, and confirm correct APN. We’ll run a speed test after each change and aim for an 'excellent' rating. While I will optimize everything I can on your account and device settings, real-world speed also depends on local network conditions; we’ll still push for the best possible performance.",
  "need_user_verification": true,
  "identity_request": {
    "please_provide_one_of": [
      "Phone number on the affected line (preferred)",
      "Customer ID",
      "Full name AND date of birth (YYYY-MM-DD)"
    ]
  },
  "questions": [
    "Are you currently in France right now, and which city are you in?",
    "What phone number/line is having the issue?",
    "Do you see signal bars and a network type (5G/4G/LTE/3G/2G) in your status bar?",
    "Is Wi‑Fi currently on? If yes, please turn it off while we test mobile data.",
    "Do you see a VPN icon or know if a VPN is active?",
    "Is this happening everywhere in France you go, or only in specific locations (e.g., indoors/underground)?"
  ],
  "on_device_checks": [
    {
      "goal": "Confirm basic connectivity and roaming settings",
      "steps": [
        "Run check_network_status and share the result here (signal strength, network type, mobile data ON/OFF, roaming ON/OFF).",
        "If Mobile Data is OFF, run toggle_data to turn it ON.",
        "If Data Roaming is OFF, run toggle_roaming to turn it ON."
      ]
    },
    {
      "goal": "Aim for the fastest network",
      "steps": [
        "Run check_network_mode_preference and share what it shows.",
        "If it shows 2G or 3G, run set_network_mode_preference with mode: \"4g_5g_preferred\"."
      ]
    },
    {
      "goal": "Eliminate common speed limiters",
      "steps": [
        "Run check_data_restriction_status; if Data Saver is ON, run toggle_data_saver_mode to turn it OFF.",
        "Run check_vpn_status; if a VPN is connected, run disconnect_vpn.",
        "Optional: Run check_wifi_calling_status; if ON and MMS/calls behave oddly, we may toggle later after data testing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "goal": "Validate carrier settings for data/MMS",
      "steps": [
        "Run check_apn_settings and share the APN name and whether an MMSC URL is set.",
        "If APN looks incorrect/missing, run reset_apn_settings, then run reboot_device to apply changes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "goal": "Measure performance",
      "steps": [
        "With Wi‑Fi OFF, run run_speed_test and share the rating (very poor/poor/fair/good/excellent). We’re targeting 'excellent'."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next_steps_from_me": [
    "Once you share your identifying info, I’ll look up your account, confirm your line is active, check if international roaming is enabled at the account level, verify your data usage against your plan, and enable roaming on the line if needed (no cost).",
    "If your plan’s data limit has been reached, I’ll outline options (temporary data refuel up to 2 GB or switching to a higher data plan) so you don’t lose connectivity.",
    "I’ll stay with you step‑by‑step and adjust based on each result until we achieve the best possible speed."
  ],
  "consent_request": "Please confirm that you authorize me to enable international roaming on your line if I find it disabled.",
  "friendly_reminder": "Reply with your phone number (or other ID) and the results of the first check_network_status so we can move quickly."
}

