      "step": "Disable any data restrictions",
      "actions": [
        "Run check_data_restriction_status.",
        "If Data Saver is ON or background data is restricted globally, run toggle_data_saver_mode to turn it OFF.",
        "Optional: Run check_app_status with app_name=\"messaging\". If it indicates background data is restricted for the app, go to your phone’s App Info for Messaging > Mobile data/network access > Allow background data usage (and unrestricted data if available).",
        "Retry sending an MMS."
      ],
      "why": "Data Saver or background restrictions can silently block MMS transfers."
    },
    {
      "step": "Refresh MMS network configuration",
      "actions": [
        "Even though your MMSC looks correct, run reset_apn_settings.",
        "Then run reboot_device.",
        "After the reboot, keep Wi‑Fi OFF, confirm Mobile Data and Roaming are still ON, and retry sending an MMS."
      ],
      "why": "A reset + reboot clears subtle APN/MMS profile issues that can persist despite appearing correct."
