      "step": "Restart the phone",
      "why": "Refreshes radios and network registration.",
      "how": "Fully power OFF, wait 10 seconds, then power ON. After it boots, wait 30–60 seconds and see if bars or 4G/LTE/5G appear."
    },
    {
      "step": "If you have a physical SIM, reseat it",
      "why": "A slightly misaligned SIM can cause persistent “No Signal.”",
