      "Settings > Network & Internet (or Connections) > SIMs (or SIM cards). It typically lists if it’s a physical SIM. Some phones show ‘eSIM’ explicitly.",
      "You can also check the phone’s edge for a small SIM tray with a pinhole (physical SIM)."
    ],
    "what_to_tell_me": "Please tell me whether it shows Physical SIM or eSIM (or send the exact wording you see). If you’re unsure, tell me your phone brand (Apple, Samsung, Google, Motorola, etc.) and I’ll provide brand‑specific steps."
