{
  "summary": "Your phone still reports “No SIM card,” so it can’t register on a network. We’ve already reseated the SIM twice carefully. The next best step is either to test the SIM in another phone to isolate the issue, or proceed to a human agent to provision an eSIM or arrange a replacement SIM.",
  "thought_process": "Since the tray is flush and the SIM is in the SIM-labeled slot with the notched corner aligned, persistent “No SIM” likely means a faulty SIM card or a SIM reader issue. Testing the SIM in another phone tells us which it is. If that’s not possible, a human agent can quickly set up an eSIM for you or arrange a replacement SIM.",
  "options_now": [
    {
      "option": "Test your SIM in another phone (if available)",
      "why": "It isolates whether the SIM card or your phone’s SIM reader is the problem.",
      "steps": [
        "Power OFF your phone and eject the SIM tray.",
        "Insert your SIM into any other unlocked phone nearby.",
        "Power that phone ON and check if it detects the SIM and shows signal bars.",
        "Results to tell me:",
        "- Detected on other phone: likely your phone’s SIM reader issue.",
        "- Not detected on other phone: the SIM is likely faulty and needs replacement."
      ]
    },
    {
      "option": "Proceed to a human agent for eSIM provisioning or SIM replacement",
      "why": "You’re traveling and need service restored quickly. A human agent can push a fresh eSIM to your Samsung or arrange a physical SIM replacement.",
      "what_to_expect": [
        "They may guide you to download/activate an eSIM profile over Wi‑Fi.",
        "After activation, we’ll confirm data roaming is ON and test MMS."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "to_speed_up_esim_provisioning": {
    "info_to_collect_now": [
      "On your phone, open the Phone app and dial *#06# (this only displays info; it won’t call).",
      "Note the EID (for eSIM) and IMEI numbers shown.",
      "Share the EID here to save time for the human agent."
    ],
    "note": "Make sure you’re connected to Wi‑Fi when activating an eSIM profile."
  },
  "what_we_already_tried": [
    "Confirmed your line is active, enabled international roaming, and added 2 GB of data.",
    "Guided checks for Airplane Mode, status bar, and SIM manager.",
    "Two careful SIM reseats with correct slot and orientation."
  ],
  "reassurance": "You didn’t do anything wrong. These outcomes happen and are fixable. None of the steps so far affect your photos or messages.",
  "questions": [
    "Do you have access to another phone to test your SIM now?",
    "If you prefer to proceed directly to a human agent for an eSIM or replacement SIM, shall I transfer you?",
    "If transferring, could you share your EID from *#06# to speed things up?"
  ]
}

